<title>USA: TF Financial stake cut by Cramer group.</title>
<headline>TF Financial stake cut by Cramer group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investor James Cramer said on Thursday it reduced its stake in TF Financial Corp to 4.7 percent or 200,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 50,000 shares of TF Financial between November 5 and 8 at prices ranging from $15.75 to $15.875 a share.</p>
